From fd56d6b558e5113972b2403d22085c5d62be5cef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ykai55 <ykai55@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:24:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add experimental Yew native renderer

Add an opt-in, renderer-neutral backend for mounting a top-level Yew component
on native targets. Support text, tags, lists, attributes, form values, and tap
callbacks while rejecting unsupported VNode output before host mutation.

Define strict direct-parent teardown, scheduler reentrancy protection,
owner-thread callbacks, explicit emergency abandonment, and panic-unwind
cleanup with regression coverage.
---
